sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant R as Redis (Central)

    Note over G: Window = 1 Min<br/>Limit = 100
    
    C->>G: Request (User A)
    G->>R: Fetch Current & Prev Counters
    R-->>G: Prev=80, Curr=20
    
    Note over G: Calculate Time %<br/>Elapsed = 15s (25%)
    
    Note over G: Estimate Rate<br/>(80 * (1 - 0.25)) + 20<br/>= (80 * 0.75) + 20<br/>= 60 + 20 = 80
    
    alt Estimate < Limit (80 < 100)
        G->>R: Increment Current Window (Lua)
        R-->>G: OK
        G-->>C: 200 OK (Allowed)
    else Estimate >= Limit
        G-->>C: 429 Too Many Requests
    end
